  "Don't worry, we'll take things step by step.",
  "This is a convention we follow in our team to easily identify and distinguish our methods.",
  "Don't worry, we'll take things step by step.",
  "Don't worry, we'll take things step by step.",
  "Don't worry, we'll take things step by step.",
  "When we talk about accountability, we're referring to taking responsibility for your work and committing to delivering on your promises.",
  "It's about being answerable to yourself, your team, and the company for the tasks and goals you've taken on.",
  "Remember, when we encourage accountability and ownership, we're not just checking items off a to-do list.",
  "For your upcoming project, I want you to take ownership of the module you're assigned to.",
  "Think beyond just writing the code.",
  "Don't worry, we'll take things step by step."
